text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Counter target spell. Untap up to four lands.', 'Echo {G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)', 'Flying\\nWhen you cast a creature spell, sacrifice Skittering Skirge.', 'Whenever Karn, Silver Golem blocks or becomes blocked, it gets -4/+4 until end of turn.\\n{1}: Target noncreature artifact becomes an artifact creature with power and toughness each equal to its mana value until end of turn.']
flavor: ['"Time flows like a river. In Tolaria we practice the art of building dams."\\n—Barrin, master wizard', "One pounce, she's hungry—you die quickly. Two, she's teaching her cubs—you're in for a long day.", "The imps' warbling cries echo through Phyrexia's towers like those of mourning doves in a cathedral."]
